    "detailed_description": "It's a first-person platformer puzzle game similar to Portal, with a rich story, a suspenseful atmosphere, and a bit of a thriller.<br />\r\nIn the game, the mirror is a door that allows you to move through two Spaces that mirror each other.<br />\r\nYou will gain the ability to open mirrors and use that ability to solve puzzles.<br />\r\nIn the process, you can read and experience a dark story.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures:<br />\r\n1. Solving puzzles.<br />\r\nSimilar to Portal, you will have the ability to open mirror doors.<br />\r\n2. Salute the Portal.<br />\r\nThere are puzzle elements common to Portal, such as cubes, energy pellets, and bounces.<br />\r\n3. Rich story.<br />\r\nExperience a suspenseful story, the atmosphere is weird, a little scary, especially at the end.<br />\r\n4. Realistic style Graphics.",
    "about_the_game": "It's a first-person platformer puzzle game similar to Portal, with a rich story, a suspenseful atmosphere, and a bit of a thriller.<br />\r\nIn the game, the mirror is a door that allows you to move through two Spaces that mirror each other.<br />\r\nYou will gain the ability to open mirrors and use that ability to solve puzzles.<br />\r\nIn the process, you can read and experience a dark story.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures:<br />\r\n1. Solving puzzles.<br />\r\nSimilar to Portal, you will have the ability to open mirror doors.<br />\r\n2. Salute the Portal.<br />\r\nThere are puzzle elements common to Portal, such as cubes, energy pellets, and bounces.<br />\r\n3. Rich story.<br />\r\nExperience a suspenseful story, the atmosphere is weird, a little scary, especially at the end.<br />\r\n4. Realistic style Graphics.",
